MIDI input listeners that use a message up (Segno: docs/design/midi-learn.md §5, ML8).

A controller's knob mapped to a control in Segno shouldn't also reach the armed track's
instrument (a mod wheel mapped to a filter mustn't bend the synth too). A
PhysicalMidiInputDevice::Listener may say a message is its alone (consumesMidiMessage, asked on
the MIDI thread after handleIncomingMidiMessage): then it goes no further. With no listener
saying so, nothing changes.

